msgid "Emulate Middle Mouse with Alt+Left Mouse"
msgstr "Alt+Left Mouse ﮟﯾﺮﮐ ﺪﯿﻠﻘﺗ ﯽﮐ ﺱﺅﺎﻣ ﻝﮉﻣ ﮫﺗﺎﺳ ﮯﮐ"


